4. Fixed physical convention and sign

The manuscript now defines exactly
  \Delta := \omega_c-\omega_d.
The analysis is explicitly stated to be in the frame rotating at drive
frequency `\omega_d`, and sources using `\omega_d-\omega_c` are said to use
`-\Delta` relative to this manuscript. The Hamiltonian number term remains
  +\hbar\Delta N.
No sign, coefficient, power, denominator, approximation order, hypothesis,
label, citation, or scientific-status statement was changed by the migration.

